     "tekst": "Breathing protection: If the recommended technical measures are observed, no individual protection equipment is necessary. Hand protection: If the product is handled correctly, no individual protection equipment is necessary. Eye protection: If the product is handled correctly, no individual protection equipment is necessary. Skin protection:"
