     "soort": "veld",
     "kopje": "Maintenance",
     "tekst": "Do not make any changes to the gloves that may alter their resistance, or apply paints, solvents or adhesives. Gloves should be of the appropriate size and fit the user's hand well, not being too loose or too tight."
